### How to Use This in Google Stitch:
1. Go to **[stitch.withgoogle.com](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/)** and start a new project.
2. Paste the prompt above into the generation box.
3. Stitch will generate the multi-screen canvas (Homepage, Reports Vault, Blog Article, Donation Portal, and Webmaster Dashboard) using the exact Forest Green and Cerulean Blue palette.
4. Use Stitch's **Prototype Mode** to link the buttons (e.g., clicking *"Donate"* on the homepage opens Screen 4, clicking *"View Field Reports"* navigates to Screen 2).
5. Click **Download / Export** to get the clean HTML/CSS and `DESIGN.md` ready for your builders or code agents.
